  <Properties>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Join us for a panel and discussion of WFH, in-office, and everything in-between. We’ll have a few members of the community sharing their experience with WFH, in-office, and hybrid; after some opening introductions, plus some curated questions, we’ll open it up to the audience for Q&A. We’ll also be posting a slido soon so that you can submit your questions and takes early.]]></Value>
